    "title": "Electrical Engineering Safety – Justin Benjamin",
    "description": "<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-9\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\r\n<p>Learn the fundamentals of electrical safety and best practices for working with electrical systems in both laboratory and industry settings. Alumni Justin Benjamin is coming back to share practical insights to help students recognize hazards and build safe engineering habits.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline vc_do_btn\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_btn3-container vc_btn3-inline vc_do_btn\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"vc_row wpb_row vc_row-fluid\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_column vc_column_container vc_col-sm-3\">\r\n<div class=\"vc_column-inner\">\r\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">&nbsp;</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
